sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant C as Client
  participant API as User Controller
  participant Svc as User Service
  participant DB as MongoDB
  participant Redis as Redis
  participant Socket as Socket.IO

  C->>API: PATCH /users/me { timezone/preferredCurrency }
  API->>API: derive changedFields
  API->>Svc: update(userId, body, profilePic)
  Svc->>DB: update user
  DB-->>Svc: updated user
  Svc-->>API: updated user
  API->>Redis: invalidate analytics:*:<userId>:*
  Redis-->>API: best-effort cleanup done
  API->>Socket: emit user:profile-updated
  API-->>C: 200 user profile updated

